      "content": "thanks, that's a good start. can we make it a little more personal though? i want to mention that we were particularly impressed with their experience with cloud architecture and their problem-solving during the live coding session. i want it to feel less like a template and more like we actually valued their time, without making it sound like we're giving them false hope for future roles.",
